Z||000034||FIEROCIOUS||07-19-2000||02:58 AM||||I think what hypto is saying is that he thought a Neon pod would fit a while back and no one took him serious so now he's hav'in fun with you all! <P>It's also nice to be differant!<P>Think about it, the person who came up with the Grand Am break up grade. They took the time to figure out what would work. When he/she was done he/she patted them self on the back and was proud they had the best stopping Fiero in the world! A year later happy day so does every body else!<P>Same with the mustang scoop the fist person wanted to be an individual with a unique car now he can go to his/her local shopping mall and find five other Fieros with the same scoop! (mine is one of them!) LOL!<P>That's what customizeing is all about, share some secrets but keep a couple for your self! I used to give everyone all the details on how to do this and that on cars but after a few years I'm beginning to get sick of seeing other people driveing an exact duplicate of any car I build! <P>There are those people out there that only do what has already been done (you know who you are) and there are those that set the pace for customization. <P>Lead or follow which are you?<P>And no, slapping on a cheesy NO FEAR sticker doesn't get you into the club! LOL! (No offense if some one has one.)<P>Not a flame I'm just playing in traffic!||||reg||1
